{"ancestors": "0,9016988,9017002", "bizKey": "9017004", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-07-30 19:39:06", "detail": "<p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>题材基本面介绍：</strong></span></p><p><strong>1.卫浴介绍</strong></p><p>卫浴行业由卫生陶瓷、龙头五金、浴室浴柜、浴缸浴房等产品构成。卫生陶瓷包括坐便器、蹲便器、小便器、面盆等；龙头五金包括淋浴花洒、龙头、地漏、挂件。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/27/d18ee128-503c-4392-86d5-e7a2ffcf0144-1687859258568.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 588.00px;height: 346.66px;\"/></p><p><br></p><p><strong>2.竞争格局</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/27/1619bb6a-a818-4e15-8364-04a807dbed5e-1687859370106.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 547.00px;height: 213.94px;\"/></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/27/f215a402-dd89-4153-8442-c901660c03b5-1687859403262.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 544.00px;height: 221.25px;\"/></p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "WY", "imgUrl": "", "importance": 1, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "卫浴", "parentId": 9017002, "pctChg": -0.86, "reason": "卫浴行业由卫生陶瓷、龙头五金、浴室浴柜、浴缸浴房等产品构成。卫生陶瓷包括坐便器、蹲便器、小便器、面盆等；龙头五金包括淋浴花洒、龙头、地漏、挂件。", "remark": null, "sort": 0, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9017004, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2025-08-26 10:40:54"}
